{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>For you have plundered</b> שלות is from the doubled root שלל, like סכות for roofs of סכך, and like it, ישלוך all the remnant of peoples. And all this evil will come upon you — because of the blood of man that you shed and the violence that you did in the land."], :book :habakkuk, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["<b>Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk</b>- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"] ["Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:07.363047228Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}